{{define "title"}}Your Chronos profile was changed{{end}}
{{define "content"}}
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;">Hello{{if .Name}} {{.Name}}{{end}},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;">Your Chronos profile was changed on <strong>{{datetime .OccurredAt}}</strong>.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;">What changed: <strong>{{.Fields}}</strong>.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;">Your profile is how colleagues recognise you — in a mention, in an
  invitation, in a member list. If you did not make this change, somebody else is reaching your
  account and appearing as you to the people you work with.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 20px;">If that was not you: sign out every device from your security
  settings, and change your password. Both take effect immediately.</p>
{{end}}
